msgctxt "136"
msgid "Hey, you all right? What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"Oh, Kiryu-san... Some tough guy I am... I was so excited\r\n"
"to come here, but look at me now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "You lost?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "Yeah... The fighters here are too damn good."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid "You should get those injuries checked out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "Kiryu-san... Will you join the tournament with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "What?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"I heard about something called the Tag Match Grand Prix.\r\n"
"Will you fight in that with me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid "Why me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid "Like I said before... I want to be your apprentice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"But if I can't do that, then the least I could do is watch\r\n"
"you fight and learn a thing or two."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid "You really think you can learn something like that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Definitely. I just need to really get in close."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid ""
"The best way to do that is fight together, right? So please,\r\n"
"team up with me in the Tag Match Grand Prix!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "(Hmm. This guy might make a good tag match partner...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "364"
msgid "Sure, why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "376"
msgid "For real!? Thank you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "388"
msgid "No problem."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Okay. I'll go ahead and register us as a team for the Grand\r\n"
"Prix. Just come by the Coliseum anytime!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Sure. Just get those injuries looked at, all right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid ""
"Oh, right! I will! Once I'm all healed up, let's kick some\r\n"
"ass, together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid "See you later!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "No."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "532"
msgid "Why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid "Teaming up with you doesn't guarantee we'll win."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid ""
"Plus, if you keep fighting, you'll just put yourself\r\n"
"into worse shape."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"That's not true! I know that we'd win if we entered the\r\n"
"tournament together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid ""
"Besides, even on the off chance we didn't win, I still\r\n"
" wouldn't regret a thing. And I promise I won't slow\r\n"
"you down. Please! I'm beggin' you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "All right, you talked me into it. Sure, why not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid "For real!? Thank you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "You got it."
msgstr ""

